    "description": {
      "content": "Part of the Deliveroo Retail Platform Suite. The Picking API supports the grocery picking flow, letting operators fetch active orders, start picking, update item availability with substitutions or amendments, and accept or reject orders prior to courier handoff. Authentication uses an OAuth 2.0 client credentials bearer token.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Kin Lane\n Email: kin@apievangelist.com",
